  "description": "The Cuemon.Diagnostics namespace contains types that provide ways for developers to describe exceptions including evidence to why an operation faulted. Also includes a flexible, generic and lambda friendly way to perform both synchronous and asynchronous time measuring operations. The namespace is an addition to the System.Diagnostics namespace.",
